oah Dobson had another rough one and Florian Xhekaj chose a bad time to settle a score. www.nytimes.com/athletic/781...","u":"https://bsky.app/profile/arponbasu.bsky.social/post/3n37yjy7ywk2q"},{"a":"Eric Engels","d":"2026-11-26T08:15:31+00:00","h":"ericengels.bsky.social","o":"Sportsnet","t":"No Guhle and no Matheson is no good for the Canadiens.\nThey better hope Guhle is alright. Matheson, who's on LTI, will miss at least five more games. \nThe timing of it all is a major problem, with the Canadiens struggling... \nwww.sportsnet.ca/nhl/article/...","u":"https://bsky.app/profile/ericengels.bsky.social/post/3n37aa2wohk25"},{"a":"Corey Masisak","d":"2026-11-26T06:54:04+00:00","h":"cmasisak22.bsky.social","o":"Denver Post","t":"Gabe Landeskog didn't like Arber, Florian Xhekaj's antics. Habs didn't like his hit on Kaiden Guhle. \n\n\"I think for one of the most storied franchises and one of the most respected franchises in all of hockey, and then you’ve got two guys doing that.\"\n\nwww.denverpost.com/2026/11/25/a...","u":"https://bsky.app/profile/cmasisak22.bsky.social/post/3n373ogq5n22m"},{"a":"Karine Hains","d":"2026-11-26T04:04:43+00:00","h":"karinehains.bsky.social","o":"The Hockey News","t":"Florian Xhekaj invites Landeskog, who was the one who hit Guhle, to drop them, the Avs' captain says thanks but no thanks. The younger Xhekaj heads to the box on his own #GoHabsGo","u":"https://bsky.app/profile/karinehains.bsky.social/post/3n36s7m6wck2f"},{"a":"Karine Hains","d":"2026-11-26T03:54:36+00:00","h":"karinehains.bsky.social","o":"The Hockey News","t":"The Habs didn't score on the power play, but they at least got two very good opportunities. Small victories and all that. However, Guhle has now gone to the Habs' room #GoHabsGo","u":"https://bsky.app/profile/karinehains.bsky.social/post/3n36rnipwdc2f"}],"team":"MTL","threads":[],"videos":[]}